      "messages": {
        "202290000": {
          "id": 202290000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "<u>真相只有一個，不是這個就是那個——這本《21道題告別低效推理》，我只花了0.99秒就全學會了，超過了二相樂園99.99%的人，你也來試試看吧</u>",
          "next": [
            202290001,
            202290003
          ]
        },
        "202290001": {
          "id": 202290001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "原來賣書還得會量子速讀？",
          "next": [
            202290002
          ]
        },
        "202290002": {
          "id": 202290002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "放馬過來，我能更快",
          "next": [
            202290005
          ]
        },
        "202290003": {
          "id": 202290003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "這是幫書宣傳的委託嗎？",
          "next": [
            202290004
          ]
        },
        "202290004": {
          "id": 202290004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "來吧，我能贏你",
          "next": [
            202290005
          ]
        },
        "202290005": {
          "id": 202290005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "嚐鮮版第一題：",
          "next": [
            202290006
          ]
        },
        "202290006": {
          "id": 202290006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "「夜裡，受害者在廚房找吃的，只聽到『啪』的一聲，他死了」請你還原案情——",
          "next": [
            202290007,
            202290012,
            202290017
          ]
        },
        "202290007": {
          "id": 202290007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "飢腸轆轆的受害者潛入他人廚房準備飽餐一頓，不巧與察覺到異響的屋主迎面撞上，被屋主擊倒",
          "next": [
            202290008
          ]
        },
        "202290008": {
          "id": 202290008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "嗯，很合理的入室行竊，但你似乎漏了『啪』這條關鍵線索",
          "next": [
            202290009
          ]
        },
        "202290009": {
          "id": 202290009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "為什麼是『啪』的一聲，不是『啊』的一聲？",
          "next": [
            202290010
          ]
        },
        "202290010": {
          "id": 202290010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "答案揭曉——",
          "next": [
            202290011
          ]
        },
        "202290011": {
          "id": 202290011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "受害者是一隻蟑螂",
          "next": [
            202290021
          ]
        },
        "202290012": {
          "id": 202290012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "屋主餓到不行，因為急著吃了變質的食物而身亡，「啪」的一聲倒在地上",
          "next": [
            202290013
          ]
        },
        "202290013": {
          "id": 202290013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "看似他殺，實則意外，逆轉思維不錯，可惜不對",
          "next": [
            202290014
          ]
        },
        "202290014": {
          "id": 202290014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "人，什麼時候都會餓，什麼時候都能吃，但題眼卻強調「夜裡」",
          "next": [
            202290015
          ]
        },
        "202290015": {
          "id": 202290015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "答案揭曉——",
          "next": [
            202290016
          ]
        },
        "202290016": {
          "id": 202290016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "受害者是一隻蟑螂",
          "next": [
            202290021
          ]
        },
        "202290017": {
          "id": 202290017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "夜裡…廚房…吃飯…『啪』的一聲……",
          "next": [
            202290018
          ]
        },
        "202290018": {
          "id": 202290018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "受害者是一隻蟑螂",
          "next": [
            202290019
          ]
        },
        "202290019": {
          "id": 202290019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我亂猜的",
          "next": [
            202290020
          ]
        },
        "202290020": {
          "id": 202290020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "神探啊！",
          "next": [
            202290021
          ]
        },
        "202290021": {
          "id": 202290021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "我偵破的案件也大多如此，情理之中，又意料之外",
          "next": [
            202290022
          ]
        },
        "202290022": {
          "id": 202290022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "所以，教科書等級的推理工具書，你確定不來一本？",
          "next": [
            202290023
          ]
        },
        "202290023": {
          "id": 202290023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "再來一題感受一下：「受害者外出散步碰到長長綠綠的東西，意外身亡」請你還原案情——",
          "next": [
            202290024
          ]
        },
        "202290024": {
          "id": 202290024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "呃…等一下",
          "next": [
            202290025
          ]
        },
        "202290025": {
          "id": 202290025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "拿成《腦筋急轉彎》了",
          "next": [
            202290026
          ]
        },
        "202290026": {
          "id": 202290026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "也是一種推理書吧，能不能真的學到東西另當別論",
          "next": [
            202290027
          ]
        },
        "202290027": {
          "id": 202290027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "沒關係",
          "next": [
            202290028
          ]
        },
        "202290028": {
          "id": 202290028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "這本也在我的委託之中",
          "next": [
            202290029
          ]
        },
        "202290029": {
          "id": 202290029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "<u>9到999歲都能看懂——這本《腦筋急轉彎》，我只花了0.99秒就全學會了，超過了二相樂園99.99%的人，你也來試試看吧</u>",
          "next": [
